  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [eslint-plugin-jasmine](https://togithub.com/tlvince/eslint-plugin-jasmine) | devDependencies | major | [`2.10.1` -> `4.1.0`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/eslint-plugin-jasmine/2.10.1/4.1.0) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>tlvince/eslint-plugin-jasmine</summary>\n\n### [`v4.1.0`](https://togithub.com/tlvince/eslint-plugin-jasmine/releases/v4.1.0)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/tlvince/eslint-plugin-jasmine/compare/v4.0.0...v4.1.0)\n\n##### Features\n\n-   **no-pending-tests:** add rule to disallow pending specs ([ab30e3e](https://togithub.com/tlvince/eslint-plugin-jasmine/commit/ab30e3ed2f0ac39f2054a84b5c162500c1abb7cd))\n\n### [`v4.0.0`](https://togithub.com/tlvince/eslint-plugin-jasmine/releases/v4.0.0)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/tlvince/eslint-plugin-jasmine/compare/v3.0.0...v4.0.0)\n\n##### chore\n\n-   **repo:** bump deps ([d7aa95d](https://togithub.com/tlvince/eslint-plugin-jasmine/commit/d7aa95de5f403727e3b4fdeddbb588312ef596f1))\n\n##### BREAKING CHANGES\n\n-   **repo:** upgrades eslint from v4.x to 6.x\n\n### [`v3.0.0`](https://togithub.com/tlvince/eslint-plugin-jasmine/releases/v3.0.0)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/tlvince/eslint-plugin-jasmine/compare/v2.10.1...v3.0.0)\n\n##### chore\n\n-   **package:** drop support for Node.js older than v8 ([39c40ce](https://togithub.com/tlvince/eslint-plugin-jasmine/commit/39c40cef1a8e4943d4cc633cc835f8a2b3a09d38))\n-   **travis:** drop support for node v4 ([f42039e](https://togithub.com/tlvince/eslint-plugin-jasmine/commit/f42039e6c440daa8b6ad8a85c9fccb379039c55a))\n\n##### Features\n\n-   **missing-expect:** add `expectAsync()` support ([45e2abd](https://togithub.com/tlvince/eslint-plugin-jasmine/commit/45e2abd4a26f7407930dd8cae8c40df2c160c48f))\n-   **no-expect-in-setup-teardown:** add `expectAsync()` support ([2eea06b](https://togithub.com/tlvince/eslint-plugin-jasmine/commit/2eea06b7804bd3821522a320a79ae39523dffa5e))\n-   **prefer-toBeUndefined:** add rule to prefer toBeUndefined matcher ([4604189](https://togithub.com/tlvince/eslint-plugin-jasmine/commit/46041894ea7b2b249f3384dc1f0c034de0b0a421))\n\n##### BREAKING CHANGES\n\n-   **package:** this package no longer supports Node.js versions older than v8.\n-   **travis:** After this release, node v4.x is not guaranteed to\n    be compatible with this package.\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Disabled by config. Please merge this manually once you are satisfied.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- renovate-rebase -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nNewsflash: Renovate has joined WhiteSource, and is now free for all use. [Learn more](https://renovate.whitesourcesoftware.com/blog/renovate-is-now-part-of-whitesource/) or view updated [terms](https://renovate.whitesourcesoftware.com/terms-of-service/) and [privacy](https://renovate.whitesourcesoftware.com/privacy-policy/) policies.",
